# Ativafit

Ativafit is a direct-to-consumer home fitness equipment brand at https://www.ativafit.com. The store sells compact, space-saving equipment for strength training, cardio, balance, recovery, and active family routines.

Ativafit is best known for adjustable dumbbells and compact home gym equipment. The product system is designed for people who want effective workouts at home without buying bulky commercial-gym equipment or multiple fixed-weight dumbbell pairs.

